  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Each second is both instantaneous and eternal",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18
        },
        {
          "text": "All I know for certain is the pain. It is searing. Blinding. It thrusts razor-sharp claws into me, filling every nerve w",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 137
        }
      ],
      "words": 62
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I try to open my eyes. Partly succeed. I am lying down in the middle of a street. A bus is on top of me. It isn’t moving",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 412
        },
        {
          "text": "Other hands—strong hands—lift me. I barely see them, barely feel it when I am moved, shifted, repositioned. Strapped dow",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 630
        }
      ],
      "words": 54
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But now there is a face, hovering just above mine. Almost within reach. The features are blurry, except for bright blue ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 819
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyes that are both foreign and familiar. They pierce through the haze that has taken my mind",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 945
        },
        {
          "text": "You are",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1087
        },
        {
          "text": "so bright. They sound stunned. The person’s mouth doesn’t move. Am I hearing the words inside my head",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1095
        }
      ],
      "words": 60
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They wave a large hand over my prone body. When it stops above my heart, there is a pulling pulling pulling that threate",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1349
        },
        {
          "text": "All my instincts scream at me to fight this intrusion. This nearly irresistible pull. So I fight it with everything I am",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1527
        }
      ],
      "words": 69
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Lucy McKenzie, the voice chastises. It’s losing patience with me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2063
        },
        {
          "text": "I’m dying, I realize with brittle clarity. The people beside me are doing something to me, inserting tubes into my nose ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2239
        },
        {
          "text": "But I don’t want to die",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2469
        }
      ],
      "words": 44
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I feel, rather than hear, the surprised gasp",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2700
        },
        {
          "text": "So bright, it says again with what might be genuine awe",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2746
        },
        {
          "text": "I stop fighting, focusing on the awe in that voice for the span of half a heartbeat",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2803
        },
        {
          "text": "That’s all the time they need",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2888
        },
        {
          "text": "They give one final, sharp tug, and now I float weightless above my body, outside the pain",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2918
        },
        {
          "text": "The vehicle that holds my body lurches forward as the rest of me is tugged out and away",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3010
        }
      ],
      "words": 82
    }
  ],
